<!-- ===== 1. OVERVIEW ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel" id="overview">
  <div class="wrap split split--top">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="Ringkasan">The brief</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Fine dining tidak boleh kelihatan seperti menu penghantaran.">Fine dining cannot look like a delivery menu.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Restoran berbintang Michelin dinilai sebelum tetamu duduk. Untuk ramai orang, imej pertama yang mereka lihat adalah gambar dalam talian &mdash; dan gambar itu menetapkan jangkaan untuk seluruh malam. Kandungan yang lemah bukan sekadar hodoh; ia menurunkan nilai yang dirasakan pada hidangan yang mengambil masa bertahun untuk disempurnakan.">A Michelin-starred restaurant is judged before a guest sits down. For most people the first image they see is online &mdash; and that image sets the expectation for the entire evening. Weak content is not just unattractive; it lowers the perceived value of dishes that took years to refine.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Jadi kami tidak menggambarkan makanan sahaja. Kami menggambarkan pengalaman: bangunan dan pintu masuk, cahaya di dalam ruang makan, tangan yang menyusun pinggan, dan hidangan siap pada saat ia dihidangkan.">So we did not shoot only the food. We shot the experience: the building and the entrance, the light inside the dining room, the hands assembling a plate, and the finished dish at the moment it goes out.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Semua tiga bab dinilai dalam satu gredasi, jadi galeri dalam talian terasa seperti satu malam &mdash; bukan tiga penggambaran berbeza.">All three chapters are graded together, so the online gallery feels like one evening &mdash; not three different shoots.</p>
      <div class="chip-row reveal" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Restoran">Restaurant</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Gaya hidup &amp; F&amp;B">Lifestyle &amp; F&amp;B</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Kuala Lumpur">Kuala Lumpur</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split__media split__media--wide reveal">
      <span class="frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <img src="assets/img/aujardin-2.jpg" alt="Interior atmosphere and lighting of the Au Jardin dining room" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap" style="margin-top:4rem">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="Tiga bab">Three chapters</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Ruang, pinggan, ketukangan.">The room, the plate, the craft.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="step-list step-list--4">
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Ruang">The room</h3>
        <p data-bm="Bahagian luar, pintu masuk dan suasana dalaman &mdash; imej yang menetapkan jangkaan sebelum menu dibuka.">Exterior, entrance and interior atmosphere &mdash; the images that set expectations before the menu opens.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Pinggan">The plate</h3>
        <p data-bm="Fotografi makanan yang menghormati susunan cef: sudut yang betul, cahaya yang betul, dan tiada apa yang ditambah ke dalam bingkai.">Food photography that respects the chef's plating: the right angle, the right light, and nothing added into the frame.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Ketukangan">The craft</h3>
        <p data-bm="Tangan, teknik dan detail dapur &mdash; bukti bahawa hidangan itu dibuat, bukan sekadar dihidangkan.">Hands, technique and kitchen detail &mdash; the evidence that a dish was made, not just served.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Satu gredasi">One grade</h3>
        <p data-bm="Ketiga-tiga bab diselesaikan dalam palet yang sama supaya galeri jenama kekal koheren merentasi setiap saluran.">All three chapters finished in the same palette so the brand gallery stays coherent across every channel.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 2. THE PLATE — showcase ===== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.8rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="01 &middot; Pinggan">01 &middot; The plate</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Makanan mempunyai tingkap yang sangat pendek.">Food has a very short window.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Sos berubah, herba layu, dan wap hilang dalam beberapa saat. Fotografi makanan pada tahap ini adalah kerja masa, bukan kerja penyuntingan &mdash; bingkai dan cahaya perlu sedia sebelum pinggan keluar dari dapur.">Sauces move, herbs wilt and steam disappears within seconds. Food photography at this level is a timing job, not an editing job &mdash; the frame and the light have to be ready before the plate leaves the kitchen.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase reveal">
      <div class="showcase__media">
        <img src="assets/img/aujardin-b-1.jpg" alt="Plated dish photographed at Au Jardin, a one Michelin Star restaurant" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="787">
      </div>
      <div class="showcase__card">
        <span class="chip" data-bm="Fotografi makanan">Food photography</span>
        <h3 data-bm="Susunan cef ialah arah seni.">The chef's plating is the art direction.</h3>
        <p data-bm="Kami tidak menyusun semula hidangan untuk kamera. Kerja kami ialah mencari sudut dan cahaya yang menunjukkan hidangan seperti yang dimaksudkan oleh cef &mdash; kemudian keluar dari jalan.">We do not restyle a dish for the camera. Our job is to find the angle and the light that show it the way the chef intended &mdash; then get out of the way.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top:1.4rem" href="services.html" data-bm="Perkhidmatan kandungan kami <span class='arrow'>&rarr;</span>">Our content services <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 3. THE CRAFT ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel">
  <div class="wrap split split--center split--rev">
    <div class="split__media split__media--wide reveal">
      <span class="frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <img src="assets/img/aujardin-c-1.jpg" alt="Kitchen detail and technique captured during the Au Jardin brand shoot" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="02 &middot; Ketukangan">02 &middot; The craft</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Bintang itu diperoleh di belakang pintu.">The star is earned behind the pass.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Hidangan siap menunjukkan hasilnya. Ketukangan menunjukkan sebabnya. Kami menggambarkan tangan, alat, dan pergerakan tepat yang berlaku beberapa saat sebelum pinggan meninggalkan dapur &mdash; kerana itulah cerita yang tidak boleh disalin oleh restoran lain.">The finished dish shows the result. The craft shows the reason. We shoot the hands, the tools and the precise movements that happen seconds before a plate leaves the kitchen &mdash; because that is the story another restaurant cannot copy.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Merakam di dalam perkhidmatan bermakna bekerja pada tempo dapur: tiada penyusunan semula, tiada permintaan berulang, dan pencahayaan yang tidak menghalang sesiapa.">Filming inside service means working at the kitchen's tempo: no restaging, no repeat requests, and lighting that gets in nobody's way.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Hasilnya ialah pustaka yang boleh digunakan untuk laman web, sosial, penyenaraian tempahan dan liputan editorial.">The result is a library that works for the website, social, booking listings and editorial coverage.</p>
      <div class="chip-row reveal" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Merakam dalam perkhidmatan">Filmed in service</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Cahaya bukan mengganggu">Non-intrusive light</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Sedia editorial">Editorial ready</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

